  "status": "Delivered audio and slower-studio preview; package and Drive metadata checks pass. Phone acceptance remains open.",
  "changes": [
    "33 original cached WAVs cover 25 action types: shared UI, upgrade/ability, pickup/special, pause/resume and result feedback, with distinct Bakery/Gelato/Crystal launch/hit/break/cup materials.",
    "Six fixed voices with a three-gameplay-voice cap, priority handling and cooldowns retain headroom; mute/background stop voices and never queue stale playback.",
    "Studio heartbeat uses a 1.30-second two-pulse cycle, 2.60-second minimum, a quieter secondary beat and synchronized original hum. Sound off, Reduced Motion and quiet-frame cream handoff remain supported.",
    "Asynchronous startup warms the 33 feedback resources through a path-only catalog; existing gameplay RNG, campaign rules and saved progress remain unchanged.",
    "Retains v076 signature abilities, themed menus, explicit no-charge purchase testing and developer settings; real Play billing remains unconnected."
